 error message to understand what went wrong.",[432,433],"hr",{},[435,436,438],"h2",{"id":437},"status-codes","Status codes",[428,440,441],{},"Here is a list of the different categories of status codes returned by the Vatly API. Use these to understand if a request was successful.",[443,444,445,458],"table",{},[446,447,448],"thead",{},[449,450,451,455],"tr",{},[452,453,454],"th",{},"Status",[452,456,457],{},"Description",[459,460,461,473,483],"tbody",{},[449,462,463,470],{},[464,465,466],"td",{},[467,468,469],"code",{},"2xx",[464,471,472],{},"A 2xx status code indicates a successful response.",[449,474,475,480],{},[464,476,477],{},[467,478,479],{},"4xx",[464,481,482],{},"A 4xx status code indicates a client error. This means there's an issue with the request.",[449,484,485,490],{},[464,486,487],{},[467,488,489],{},"5xx",[464,491,492],{},"A 5xx status code indicates a server error. This means the issue is on Vatly's end and we are automatically notified of the problem.",[494,495,497],"h3",{"id":496},"common-status-codes","Common status codes",[443,499,500,510],{},[446,501,502],{},[449,503,504,507],{},[452,505,506],{},"Code",[452,508,509],{},"Meaning",[459,511,512,522,532,542,552,562,572,582,592,606,616],{},[449,513,514,519],{},[464,515,516],{},[467,517,518],{},"200",[464,520,521],{},"OK - Request succeeded.",[449,523,524,529],{},[464,525,526],{},[467,527,528],{},"201",[464,530,531],{},"Created - Resource was successfully created.",[449,533,534,539],{},[464,535,536],{},[467,537,538],{},"204",[464,540,541],{},"No Content - Request succeeded with no response body (e.g., deletes).",[449,543,544,549],{},[464,545,546],{},[467,547,548],{},"400",[464,550,551],{},"Bad Request - The request was malformed.",[449,553,554,559],{},[464,555,556],{},[467,557,558],{},"401",[464,560,561],{},"Unauthorized - Invalid or missing API key.",[449,563,564,569],{},[464,565,566],{},[467,567,568],{},"403",[464,570,571],{},"Forbidden - The API key doesn't have permission for this action.",[449,573,574,579],{},[464,575,576],{},[467,577,578],{},"404",[464,580,581],{},"Not Found - The requested resource doesn't exist.",[449,583,584,589],{},[464,585,586],{},[467,587,588],{},"409",[464,590,591],{},"Conflict - Idempotency mismatch, request still in progress, outcome unknown, a concurrent write, or a refund of the same order already being created.",[449,593,594,599],{},[464,595,596],{},[467,597,598],{},"422",[464,600,601,602,605],{},"Unprocessable Entity - Validation failed. Check the ",[467,603,604],{},"errors"," field for details.",[449,607,608,613],{},[464,609,610],{},[467,611,612],{},"429",[464,614,615],{},"Too Many Requests - Rate limit exceeded. Slow down your requests.",[449,617,618,623],{},[464,619,620],{},[467,621,622],{},"500",[464,624,625],{},"Internal Server Error - Something went wrong on Vatly's end.",[432,627],{},[435,629,631],{"id":630},"error-responses","Error responses",[428,633,634],{},"Whenever a request is unsuccessful, the Vatly API will return an error response with a human-readable message. Combine it with the HTTP status code to understand what has gone wrong and how to fix it. Most of the error messages are pretty helpful and actionable.",[636,637,643],"pre",{"className":638,"code":639,"filename":640,"language":641,"meta":642,"style":642},"language-json shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","{\n  \"message\": \"Resource not found.\"\n}\n","Error response","json","",[467,644,645,654,680],{"__ignoreMap":642},[646,647,650],"span",{"class":648,"line":649},"line",1,[646,651,653],{"class":652},"sMK4o","{\n",[646,655,657,660,664,667,670,673,677],{"class":648,"line":656},2,[646,658,659],{"class":652},"  \"",[646,661,663],{"class":662},"spNyl","message",[646,665,666],{"class":652},"\"",[646,668,669],{"class":652},":",[646,671,672],{"class":652}," \"",[646,674,676],{"class":675},"sfazB","Resource not found.",[646,678,679],{"class":652},"\"\n",[646,681,683],{"class":648,"line":682},3,[646,684,685],{"class